{"unit_id":"OctKwong30__dsh-upload-file#feature-upload","repo":"OctKwong30/dsh-upload-file","commit":"3c3bcb5c345b171567c65402d46deaca92b17e22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-upload-file 的功能「上传附件」：在 Web 输入区选择多个本地文件或拖放文件，浏览器将其上传并放入待发送文件栏，发送消息时附加对应链接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:470-505","lib/client.js:1166-1183","lib/client.js:1133-1158"]}
{"unit_id":"OctKwong30__dsh-upload-file#feature-read","repo":"OctKwong30/dsh-upload-file","commit":"3c3bcb5c345b171567c65402d46deaca92b17e22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-upload-file 的功能「读取上传文件」：模型通过 read_uploaded_file 提交文件 id、附件注释或文件链接；文本文件返回受长度限制的文本，二进制文件返回元数据和下载地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:386-458"]}
{"unit_id":"OctKwong30__dsh-upload-file#feature-store","repo":"OctKwong30/dsh-upload-file","commit":"3c3bcb5c345b171567c65402d46deaca92b17e22","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-upload-file 的功能「持久化文件链接」：宿主接收上传内容，按 SHA-256 内容寻址保存文件及元数据，并通过 /dsh-upload/raw/<id> 提供文件下载。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:182-199","lib/index.js:264-294","lib/index.js:296-326"]}
{"unit_id":"OctKwong30__dsh-upload-file#caveat-settings","repo":"OctKwong30/dsh-upload-file","commit":"3c3bcb5c345b171567c65402d46deaca92b17e22","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-upload-file 使用前须知：上传文件默认保存在本机 ~/.dsh/uploads 目录；可用 uploadsDir 更改目录，上传大小和文本预览上限也可分别配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:461-469","lib/index.js:505-508"]}
